# Package profile: one package per line, added on top of configs/ra81-nss.config.
#   name        build the package into the image
#   -name       leave a package that would otherwise be included out of the image
# Packages must come from a feed in upstream/feeds.conf. The build fails if a
# listed package does not end up in the image (unknown name, missing feed,
# unmet dependency), so an upgrade never drops software silently.
#
# The default profile adds nothing.
